    {
      "id": "p02",
      "index": "02",
      "title": "数据模型",
      "heading": "数据模型：一切都是协议",
      "visual": "code",
      "startFrame": 4420,
      "durationInFrames": 2548,
      "durationSeconds": 84.929,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "file": "p02-0.m4a",
          "text": "为什么是 len(x)，不是 x.length()",
          "startFrame": 17,
          "durationInFrames": 286,
          "durationSeconds": 9.543
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "file": "p02-1.m4a",
          "text": "len(x) → x.__len__()：内置函数是协议入口",
          "startFrame": 312,
          "durationInFrames": 380,
          "durationSeconds": 12.678
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "file": "p02-2.m4a",
          "text": "dunder 不是语法糖，是统一的接口约定",
          "startFrame": 702,
          "durationInFrames": 304,
          "durationSeconds": 10.147
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "file": "p02-3.m4a",
          "text": "with open 能自动关文件 → __enter__ / __exit__",
          "startFrame": 1016,
          "durationInFrames": 382,
          "durationSeconds": 12.725
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "file": "p02-4.m4a",
          "text": "a + b → a.__add__(b)：运算符也是协议",
          "startFrame": 1408,
          "durationInFrames": 343,
          "durationSeconds": 11.424
        },
        {
          "index": 5,
          "file": "p02-5.m4a",
          "text": "练：给自己的类实现 3 个协议（with / 迭代 / 比较或相加）",
          "startFrame": 1760,
          "durationInFrames": 294,
          "durationSeconds": 9.799
        },
        {
          "index": 6,
          "file": "p02-6.m4a",
          "text": "读 docs：Data Model 一章，看全部协议与触发场景",
          "startFrame": 2064,
          "durationInFrames": 453,
          "durationSeconds": 15.093
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p03",
      "index": "03",
      "title": "装饰器",
      "heading": "装饰器：闭包是底，functools 是标准答案",
