      "startFrame": 6968,
      "durationInFrames": 2280,
      "durationSeconds": 75.99,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "file": "p03-0.m4a",
          "text": "会写 @wraps，说不清为什么成立",
          "startFrame": 17,
          "durationInFrames": 194,
          "durationSeconds": 6.455
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "file": "p03-1.m4a",
          "text": "闭包：内层函数记住外层变量 → 装饰器是语法包装",
          "startFrame": 220,
          "durationInFrames": 369,
          "durationSeconds": 12.307
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "file": "p03-2.m4a",
          "text": "先写 func = deco(func)，再引入 @ 语法",
          "startFrame": 599,
          "durationInFrames": 343,
          "durationSeconds": 11.424
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "file": "p03-3.m4a",
          "text": "三段式：不带参 → 带参 → 类装饰器",
          "startFrame": 951,
          "durationInFrames": 318,
          "durationSeconds": 10.612
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "file": "p03-4.m4a",
          "text": "functools：wraps / lru_cache / partial",
          "startFrame": 1279,
          "durationInFrames": 354,
          "durationSeconds": 11.796
        },
        {
          "index": 5,
          "file": "p03-5.m4a",
          "text": "练：手写 @retry(次数, 间隔)，保留函数名，超限抛异常",
          "startFrame": 1642,
          "durationInFrames": 337,
          "durationSeconds": 11.239
        },
        {
          "index": 6,
          "file": "p03-6.m4a",
          "text": "@retry 串起闭包 + 参数 + 异常 + functools",
          "startFrame": 1989,
          "durationInFrames": 259,
          "durationSeconds": 8.638
        }
      ]
    },
    {
