    {
      "id": "p06",
      "index": "06",
      "title": "GIL 与选型",
      "heading": "GIL：它到底限制了什么",
      "visual": "timeline",
      "startFrame": 13978,
      "durationInFrames": 2553,
      "durationSeconds": 85.115,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "file": "p06-0.m4a",
          "text": "分水岭：并发。误解最多的 GIL",
          "startFrame": 17,
          "durationInFrames": 194,
          "durationSeconds": 6.478
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "file": "p06-1.m4a",
          "text": "GIL：同一时刻只有一个线程执行字节码 → CPU 密集多线程无效",
          "startFrame": 220,
          "durationInFrames": 345,
          "durationSeconds": 11.494
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "file": "p06-2.m4a",
          "text": "锁的是字节码，不是等待 → IO 密集多线程有效",
          "startFrame": 575,
          "durationInFrames": 435,
          "durationSeconds": 14.513
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "file": "p06-3.m4a",
          "text": "CPU 密集 → 多进程 / 高并发 IO → asyncio / 普通 IO → 线程池",
          "startFrame": 1020,
          "durationInFrames": 473,
          "durationSeconds": 15.766
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "file": "p06-4.m4a",
          "text": "3.13 起有自由线程模式，但非默认、生态未跟上",
          "startFrame": 1502,
          "durationInFrames": 380,
          "durationSeconds": 12.655
        },
        {
          "index": 5,
          "file": "p06-5.m4a",
          "text": "练：同一任务用串行 / 线程 / 进程各跑一遍，记耗时做表",
          "startFrame": 1892,
          "durationInFrames": 378,
          "durationSeconds": 12.608
        },
        {
          "index": 6,
          "file": "p06-6.m4a",
          "text": "自己跑出来的数字，比十篇文章管用",
          "startFrame": 2280,
          "durationInFrames": 242,
          "durationSeconds": 8.081
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p07",
      "index": "07",
      "title": "asyncio",
      "heading": "asyncio：事件循环不是线程",
      "visual": "timeline",
      "startFrame": 16531,
      "durationInFrames": 2377,
      "durationSeconds": 79.241,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "file": "p07-0.m4a",
          "text": "asyncio 最常被当成多线程理解",
          "startFrame": 17,
          "durationInFrames": 201,
          "durationSeconds": 6.711
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "file": "p07-1.m4a",
          "text": "单线程 + 事件循环，轮流跑，谁等 IO 就切走",
          "startFrame": 227,
          "durationInFrames": 356,
          "durationSeconds": 11.865
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "file": "p07-2.m4a",
          "text": "await = 让出执行权，不是启动并发",
          "startFrame": 593,
          "durationInFrames": 281,
          "durationSeconds": 9.381
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "file": "p07-3.m4a",
          "text": "并发要先 create_task，再 gather / TaskGroup",
          "startFrame": 884,
          "durationInFrames": 323,
          "durationSeconds": 10.774
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "file": "p07-4.m4a",
          "text": "最大的坑：协程里调同步库 → 整个事件循环被卡住",
          "startFrame": 1217,
          "durationInFrames": 408,
          "durationSeconds": 13.607
        },
        {
          "index": 5,
          "file": "p07-5.m4a",
          "text": "练：requests 串行 → httpx 异步并发，比耗时",
          "startFrame": 1635,
          "durationInFrames": 365,
          "durationSeconds": 12.167
        },
        {
          "index": 6,
          "file": "p07-6.m4a",
          "text": "进阶：gather 异常行为 / 超时 / TaskGroup 的由来",
          "startFrame": 2009,
          "durationInFrames": 336,
          "durationSeconds": 11.215
        }
      ]
    },
